      "nets": ["/NET0086"],
      "observed": "The anodes of D2, D23, and D39 are all tied to net /NET0086, which has no other connections. No supply or pull-up is present on this net.",
      "expected": "The common anode net should be connected to a positive supply rail (e.g., +3V3) so that the LEDs can illuminate when their cathodes are pulled low by their respective drivers.",
      "evidence": [
